sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as PostStatus component
    participant P as PostStatusPresenter
    participant V as Component listener
    participant CS as Client StatusService
    participant F as ServerFacade
    participant CC as ClientCommunicator
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant L as PostStatusLambda
    participant SS as Server StatusService

    UI-)P: submitPost(post, currentUser, authToken, event)
    activate P
    P->>P: doFailureReportingOperation(operation, description, cleanup)
    P->>V: setIsLoading(true)
    P->>V: displayInfoMessage("Posting status...", 0)
    V-->>P: postingStatusToastId
    P->>P: getStatus(post, currentUser, Date.now())

    P-)CS: postStatus(authToken, status)
    activate CS
    Note over P,CS: Await submission without blocking the browser

    CS-)F: postStatus({token: authToken.token, newStatus: status.dto})
    activate F
    F-)CC: doPost(request, "/lambda/status/post")
    activate CC
    CC->>CC: JSON.stringify(request)

    CC-)API: HTTP POST /lambda/status/post with JSON body
    activate API
    API-)L: handler(request)
    activate L
    L->>L: validatePostStatusRequest(request)

    L-)SS: postStatus(request.token, request.newStatus)
    activate SS
    Note over SS: Milestone 3 acknowledges submission without persistence
    SS-->>L: Promise resolves with undefined
    deactivate SS

    L-->>API: {success: true, message: null}
    deactivate L
    API-->>CC: HTTP 200 with JSON response
    deactivate API

    CC->>CC: await response.json()
    CC-->>F: PostStatusResponse
    deactivate CC
    F->>F: Check response.success
    F-->>CS: Promise resolves with undefined
    deactivate F
    CS-->>P: Promise resolves with undefined
    deactivate CS

    P->>P: clearPost(event)
    P->>V: setPost("")
    P->>V: displayInfoMessage("Status posted!", 2000)
    deactivate P
